<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's JSE suspends CDC share listing.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's JSE suspends CDC share listing.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said on Tuesday it had suspended the listing of Consolidated Diamond Corporation Ltd shares from February 4.</p>
<p>The exchange said in a statement the company had failed to comply with the JSE's listings requirement by not submitting its annual financial statements within seven months of its financial year end.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
